#: ../../data-export.rst:2
msgid "Exporting"
msgstr "导出"

#: ../../data-export.rst:4
msgid ""
"The export button captures exactly what is on screen — same colours, same "
"labels, same zoom — and writes it to a file."
msgstr "导出按钮抓取的就是屏幕上看到的内容——同样的配色、同样的标签、同样的缩放——写进文件。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:8
msgid "Formats"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../data-export.rst:14
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ../../data-export.rst:15
msgid "Extension"
msgstr "扩展名"

#: ../../data-export.rst:16
msgid "When to use it"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../data-export.rst:17
msgid "PNG"
msgstr "PNG"

#: ../../data-export.rst:18
msgid "``.png``"
msgstr "``.png``"

#: ../../data-export.rst:19
msgid ""
"Slides, quick sharing. Rendered at the current device pixel ratio, so it "
"stays sharp on a HiDPI display."
msgstr "做幻灯片、快速分享。按当前设备像素比渲染，在高分屏上依然清晰。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:21
msgid "SVG"
msgstr "SVG"

#: ../../data-export.rst:22
msgid "``.svg``"
msgstr "``.svg``"

#: ../../data-export.rst:23
msgid ""
"Editing in Illustrator or Inkscape. Text stays text, strokes stay strokes."
msgstr "需要在 Illustrator 或 Inkscape 里编辑。文字还是文字，描边还是描边。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:25
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: ../../data-export.rst:26
msgid "``.pdf``"
msgstr "``.pdf``"

#: ../../data-export.rst:27
msgid "Journal figures. Vector, with an embedded font."
msgstr "期刊插图。矢量，字体已嵌入。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:29
msgid ""
"File names are generated from the locus so you can export several views "
"without renaming anything::"
msgstr "文件名按位点自动生成，导多个视图不用手动改名："

#: ../../data-export.rst:35
msgid "What is included"
msgstr "导出内容"

#: ../../data-export.rst:37
msgid "Every visible track, in the same order and with the same heights"
msgstr "所有可见轨道，顺序和高度都与屏幕一致"

#: ../../data-export.rst:38
msgid "Track labels and the axis on the left"
msgstr "左侧的轨道标签和坐标轴"

#: ../../data-export.rst:39
msgid "Split view: all panes side by side, at their on-screen widths"
msgstr "分屏时所有面板按屏幕宽度并排"

#: ../../data-export.rst:40
msgid "The selection highlight, if there is one"
msgstr "选区高亮（如果有）"

#: ../../data-export.rst:42
msgid ""
"Hidden tracks are not exported. If you want a figure without the ruler, "
"uncheck it first — the export is a photograph of the window, not a separate "
"renderer with its own options."
msgstr "隐藏的轨道不会被导出。想去掉标尺就先把它取消勾选——导出是窗口的「照片」，不是另有一套选项的独立渲染器。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:47
msgid "Vector export notes"
msgstr "矢量导出的几点说明"

#: ../../data-export.rst:49
msgid ""
"SVG and PDF are drawn with real vector primitives, not by embedding a "
"bitmap. A few consequences are worth knowing:"
msgstr "SVG 和 PDF 用真正的矢量图元绘制，不是嵌一张位图。有几点后果值得知道："

#: ../../data-export.rst:52
msgid "Signal tracks become one path per sample, so they scale cleanly"
msgstr "信号轨道每个样本一条路径，缩放后依然干净"

#: ../../data-export.rst:53
msgid "Gene models keep their exon rectangles and arrows as separate objects"
msgstr "基因模型的外显子矩形和箭头都是独立对象"

#: ../../data-export.rst:54
msgid ""
"Dense labels are laid out exactly as on screen, including the ones that sit "
"on top of features — the export does not re-flow text"
msgstr "标签排版与屏幕完全一致，包括压在特征上的那些——导出不会重排文字"

#: ../../data-export.rst:56
msgid ""
"Very large exports (a whole chromosome at base resolution) produce large "
"files; export a window instead"
msgstr "超大范围导出（整条染色体到碱基分辨率）文件会很大；建议只导一个窗口"

#: ../../data-export.rst:61
msgid ""
"For a publication figure, zoom until the scale reads something like ``10 "
"bp/px``, then export SVG. Illustrator opens it with every label still "
"editable, so you can nudge a gene name without redrawing anything."
msgstr ""
"做发表用的图，先放大到比例尺显示 ``10 bp/px`` 左右，再导 SVG。Illustrator 打开后每个标签都可编辑，挪一下基因名不用重画。"

#: ../../data-export.rst:66
msgid "Batch export"
msgstr "批量导出"

#: ../../data-export.rst:68
msgid ""
"There is no batch mode yet. For many views, use split view to place up to "
"four loci in one canvas and export once — each pane keeps its own "
"coordinates."
msgstr "目前没有批量模式。要导很多视图时，用分屏把最多四个位点放进同一块画布一次导出——每个面板保留各自的坐标。"
